{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"easter_eggs/menus/16010369_1_1.jp.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_16010369:1:1","lang":"jp","texts":{"menu:510200255:1":{"text":"このニャン様をからかうとは、いい度胸ね！","source_cn":"竟敢戏弄本喵！","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:愤怒的猫咪":{"text":"激怒しているネコ","source":"愤怒的猫咪","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/jp/ep6/env_story/16311440.json":{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16311440","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16311440","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1631144001:0":{"text":"ニャ……ニャー！","source_cn":"喵……喵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15D94D81975E771C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:愤怒的猫咪":{"text":"激怒しているネコ","source":"愤怒的猫咪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep6/env_story/16311441.json":{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16311441","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16311441","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1631144101:0":{"text":"ニャ……ニャー！","source_cn":"喵……喵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15D94D81975E771C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:1631144101":{"text":"1631144101","source":"1631144101","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep6/env_story/16311450.json":{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16311450","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16311450","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1631145001:1":{"text":"さっき、走っていったネズミを見なかった？","source_cn":"你刚才有没有见到一只跑来的老鼠？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBDC5ABF9B3FC20C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1631145001":{"text":"さっき、走っていったネズミを見なかった？","source_cn":"你刚才有没有见到一只跑来的老鼠？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBDC5ABF9B3FC20C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631145002:1":{"text":"ふんっ、きっとこの穴へ逃げ込んだのね！こっちが必死に追ってるのに、あいつは振り向いて変顔までしてきたのよ！","source_cn":"哼！它肯定是钻进这个洞里了！我追它一路，它倒好，一路回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64DE80DFF4073736","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631145003:1":{"text":"なんて恥知らずな泥棒なの！人間の食料だけならまだしも、ほかの動物の冬の蓄えまで盗むなんて！今日こそ、あの小悪党に思い知らせてやるわ！","source_cn":"那个无耻的小偷！偷人类的东西也就算了，连其他动物过冬的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x152D2D647D07238A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631145004:1":{"text":"魔法が使えるみたいだけど、代わりに中を見てきてくれない？アタシにこの穴は小さすぎて……","source_cn":"我看你好像会点魔法……你能帮我进去看看吗？这个洞对我来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE2C48D8E889E89A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1631145004":{"text":"魔法が使えるみたいだけど、代わりに中を見てきてくれない？アタシにこの穴は小さすぎて……","source_cn":"我看你好像会点魔法……你能帮我进去看看吗？这个洞对我来说太小了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE2C48D8E889E89A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1631145005:1":{"text":"よかった！じゃあお願いするわね！","source_cn":"太好了！那就拜托你了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5776DCC350AE4A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1631145007:1":{"text":"間違いなくこの下にいるの！ほら、早く見てきて！","source_cn":"它肯定就在下面！快，快去看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0D7CFE8A91DEEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"それくらいなら、いいよ。","source_cn":"这并不难","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5C2339C5110C57CB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"それくらいなら、いいよ。","female":"それくらいなら、いいわよ。","variant_male_record_index":"85043","variant_female_record_index":"85044","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1631145006:1":{"text":"見返り？まあ、民のための悪党退治ってことで、ここはひとつ助けてよ！もしかしたら、動物界で名声を得られるかもしれないわよ！","source_cn":"好处？喵呜……就当是为民除害，帮大家一个忙嘛！说不定…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DA9B09EF9BFF7A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"見返りはあるのか？","source_cn":"我有什么好处？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x84833E2F8673E402","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"見返りはあるのか？","female":"見返りはあるの？","variant_male_record_index":"85045","variant_female_record_index":"85046","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"気付かなかったよ。","source_cn":"没注意到","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xED4FDB787D06B24B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"気付かなかったよ。","female":"気付かなかったわ。","variant_male_record_index":"85039","variant_female_record_index":"85040","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"君しか見えなかったよ。","source_cn":"我只看到了你","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x57F0331ACC6AF0FC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"君しか見えなかったよ。","female":"あなたしか見えなかったわ。","variant_male_record_index":"85041","variant_female_record_index":"85042","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:愤怒的猫咪":{"text":"激怒しているネコ","source":"愤怒的猫咪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep6/env_story/16311460.json":{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16311460","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16311460","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:0:1631146001:1":{"text":"あなたは再び変身魔法を使って、小さな穴へと入っていった。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5400A2A0BFF3BFEF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あなたは再び変身魔法を使って、小さな穴へと入っていった。","female":"あなたは再び変身魔法を使って、小さな穴へと入っていった。","variant_male_record_index":"212280","variant_female_record_index":"212281","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1631146002:1":{"text":"ハムスターの視点になると、この洞穴は十分に広く感じられた。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6ECB6003EBBE8BE8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ハムスターの視点になると、この洞穴は十分に広く感じられた。","female":"ハムスターの視点になると、この洞穴は十分に広く感じられた。","variant_male_record_index":"212282","variant_female_record_index":"212283","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1631146003:1":{"text":"あなたは注意深く匂いを嗅ぎ、足跡だらけの地面からわりと新しく、行き先のはっきりした小さな足跡を見つけた。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCD51CA84FABCAED1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あなたは注意深く匂いを嗅ぎ、足跡だらけの地面からわりと新しく、行き先のはっきりした小さな足跡を見つけた。","female":"あなたは注意深く匂いを嗅ぎ、足跡だらけの地面からわりと新しく、行き先のはっきりした小さな足跡を見つけた。","variant_male_record_index":"212284","variant_female_record_index":"212285","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1631146004:1":{"text":"その足跡はまっすぐ伸び、やがて別の出口で途切れていた。どうやら標的は無事に逃げおおせたようだ。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0D792B05949D5260","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"その足跡はまっすぐ伸び、やがて別の出口で途切れていた。どうやら標的は無事に逃げおおせたようだ。","female":"その足跡はまっすぐ伸び、やがて別の出口で途切れていた。どうやら標的は無事に逃げおおせたようだ。","variant_male_record_index":"212286","variant_female_record_index":"212287","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"黒画面","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep6/env_story/16311470.json":{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16311470","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16311470","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1631147001:0":{"text":"どう？あの小悪党は見つかった？","source_cn":"怎么样？找到那个小坏蛋的踪迹了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFDA271FF9BDEFAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1631147001":{"text":"どう？あの小悪党は見つかった？","source_cn":"怎么样？找到那个小坏蛋的踪迹了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFDA271FF9BDEFAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631147002:0":{"text":"くそっ！逃げ道までちゃんと用意してるなんて、これは常習的犯行に違いないわ！","source_cn":"可恶！这家伙居然连逃跑路线都规划好了！真是个狡猾的惯犯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x950DD5ED00E4DE8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631147003:0":{"text":"よりによってアタシの縄張りで好き放題するなんて……ぜったいに許さない！","source_cn":"竟敢在我的地盘上这么嚣张！我发誓绝不会放过他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24DFFCAA0CFEEDF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631147004:0":{"text":"でもまあ……ありがとね。少なくとも、この穴を見張り続ける必要はなくなったわ。","source_cn":"哼……不过还是谢了。至少现在我知道不用再像个傻瓜一样死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC89C63FB13B34E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631147005:0":{"text":"いつかあいつを捕まえたら、その功績はちゃんと連名にするから安心して！","source_cn":"如果哪天我逮住了他，这份功劳肯定算你一份！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x000072CA81929F12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"（状況を伝える）","source_cn":"（告知情况）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x97F29D368D6704B0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（状況を伝える）","female":"（状況を伝える）","variant_male_record_index":"85047","variant_female_record_index":"85048","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:愤怒的猫咪":{"text":"激怒しているネコ","source":"愤怒的猫咪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":1}}}}